1. In CMD change directory to the same folder where script is and run:
python pd2_crate_extract.py "(enter here full path to scripts.crate)SteamLibrary\steamapps\common\PAYDAY 2\assets\scripts.crate" -o "C:\PD2_scripts"

Note: don't forget to put your right path to scripts.crate file, and if you wish you can change "C:\PD2_scripts" to wherever you want to have your extracted files

2. Download https://github.com/marsinator358/luajit-decompiler-v2

3. Do in CMD:
mkdir C:\PD2_decompiled

3. In the same folder where decompiler run in CMD:
luajit-decompiler-v2.exe "C:\PD2_scripts" -o "C:\PD2_decompiled" -e lua -s